# Phase workflow

When the user says **implement phase X** (0–8):

1. Read `docs/RECEIPTBRAIN-PHASES.md` → `## Phase X`
2. Ask only `ASK:` questions not already answered
3. Apply `.cursor/rules/tdd-testing.mdc` for every behavior change
4. Run phase exit-criteria commands before completion
5. Report: what was built, commands run, open follow-ups

Use skill `.cursor/skills/phase-implementer/SKILL.md` for full checklist.

Documentation-only phase requests skip TDD.
